// Curated catalog of common consumer home-surveillance cameras.
//
// Parsed by `observation_core::camera::Catalog::from_ron` (see
// crates/observation-core/src/camera.rs). Documentation: docs/camera-catalog.md.
//
// Units: hfov_deg / vfov_deg in degrees; resolution = [width, height] px of the
// main stream; ir_range_m in metres (feet x 0.3048, rounded to 1 decimal).
// ir_range_m = None means the manufacturer publishes no night-vision distance
// (the app then models zero range at night rather than guessing).
//
// Source policy: values come from the manufacturer's spec / tech-specs / support
// page linked in `source`. Where only a diagonal FOV is published, H/V are derived
// with the rectilinear formula h = 2*atan(tan(d/2) * w / sqrt(w^2 + h^2)) and the
// note says "derived from diagonal". Unverifiable models are omitted, not guessed.
// Vendor "" entries are vendor-neutral archetypes (source None).
// Sorted by kind (enum order), then vendor, then name.
//
// Last verified: 2026-10.
